      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n15",
        "exercise": "160",
        "text": "160. 已知平面$\\alpha$和与$\\alpha$相交的直线$l$。对每个点$M\\notin\\alpha$，规定它对应的点$M_1$满足：$(MM_1)\\parallel l$，且平面$\\alpha$平分线段$MM_1$（图61）。平面$\\alpha$上的每个点都对应自身。对这样给出的空间到自身的映射，分别判断：\n1) 它是空间变换吗？\n2) 它是位移吗？"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-projection-configuration",
        "description": "Actual pixels contain four labelled dots M,N above the plane patch and M1,N1 below it, plus three unlabelled dots where MM1,NN1,l meet alpha. Three solid transverse segments join the left two spans: upper M-N slopes down to the right in screen space, the middle segment connects their two plane dots with a smaller slope, and lower M1-N1 is nearly horizontal. MM1 is longer than NN1. The three near-vertical spans are solid above their plane dots, dashed behind the plane until its lower outline, then solid below the outline. Line l has an upper label but no endpoint dots or arrows. Exact parallelism and midpoint coordinates are approved-exercise regularization, not source measurements. All seven source dots are retained in this shared group.",
        "requires": ["pointRelationships"],
        "objects": ["m", "n", "m1", "n1", "m-alpha", "n-alpha", "l-alpha", "mn", "m-alpha-n-alpha", "m1-n1", "m-front", "m-hidden", "m-lower", "n-front", "n-hidden", "n-lower", "l-upper", "l-hidden", "l-lower", "l"],
